      "content": "<p>Match List I with List II.</p>\n<p>\n<table class=\"tg\" style=\"undefined;table-layout: fixed; width: 545px\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 35px\">\n<col style=\"width: 244px\">\n<col style=\"width: 34px\">\n<col style=\"width: 232px\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-7btt\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-7btt\">List I</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-7btt\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-7btt\">List II</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">(A)</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Benzenesulphonyl chloride</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">(I)</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Test for primary amines</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">(B)</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Hoffmann bromamide reaction</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">(II)</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Anti Saytzeff</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">(C)</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Carbylamine reaction</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">(III)</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Hinsberg reagent</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">(D)</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Hoffmann orientation</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">(IV)</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Known reaction of Isocyanates.</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
